<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-30T08:49:36.097Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 08:49:36 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Jordan resumed airstrikes in southern Syria targeting Daesh, prompting Syrian condemnation and reports of civilian casualties, while a joint security committee and investigation into the strikes were agreed between the two states and the Nasib border crossing reopened. Syrian security forces killed a French jihadist in Harem and another French fighter in Idlib, and unidentified gunmen killed two Syrian defence ministry personnel in Idlib. Heavy rain and flash floods across Syria killed five people, including four children. Syria announced the release of 57 prisoners transferred from Lebanon and joined an Arab anti-drug conference in Tunisia to boost regional cooperation. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxOdHFuTnlKdUxQNFE3RVJQVkRyWEd6UERyNnpOelVYak0tMU1OekpmWEJySmVMY3JaN25XNWRoY2gxSkhHbjRoOFFaR3hiZk5oVnZfOFZIT2ZvUjJ0T2I0QmpUUGdzTUdVdkVnMkVTLURBNEJmNTZBOXVGTEh5R0EyVzVpS0pZU3poQmd4aFE0YnJ2SXdPejhNbUFkRndveUVUWU42OXdjZnUzbTJKY3Rkc1ozeV9FbURlR2pnREhmMUc0VkNySE9LYmltcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5pYXpOaU11eWlMdEJOZGFTd19BajdtU1VpR0htbEhKaE50RFhBeVpKVXRDc2ZGLVlmWUtmRDNUWDgxenRvQVdjZg?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Enab Baladi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZEFVX3lxTFBsWVhzZndjVjJGWko5MUtGb0hCR3N5Z19yZ0tRWjFwTGJVYS1JZFM3MXJvajhxMWxHNmp3NTFXN2pWTG5BaEZFM1hPZmJHUzBOTDBFS1Z1ZVZiNURaMXlpYV95OWI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daijiworld&lt